{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01FHMD7YmQZDWiqnBdbtfdci","type":"tool_result","content":"# .anchor/ — Anchor R&D per-project store\r\n\r\nThis directory is created and managed by Anchor's R&D control surface. Each\r\nregistered project gets an isolated namespace at:\r\n\r\n    .anchor/projects/<project-id>/\r\n        research/      planning/      build/      deliverables/      jobs/\r\n\r\nMultiple projects may share one folder; each has its own `<project-id>` subtree,\r\nso their stores never collide.\r\n\r\n## Tracking policy (C9 git-trackable vs C10 no-leak)\r\n\r\n- **Tracked (C9):** small JSON *pointer-records* that index efforts/versions —\r\n  these are committed so effort history is durable across restarts.\r\n- **Ignored (C10):** raw job logs, large generated artifacts (PDF), and any\r\n  `raw/` payloads that could carry absolute paths, tokens, or personal data.\r\n  The distribution build (Wave 8) additionally scans for and refuses to ship\r\n  anything under `.anchor/`.\r\n\r\nSee the sibling `.gitignore` for the exact rules.\r\n---PROJECTS---\nC:\\Users\\john\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\pytest-of-john\\pytest-2183\\test_session_card_inline_expan0\\P\\.anchor\\projects/b478534e94d447de82ccb4c2e1bddb52/discovery.json\nC:\\Users\\john\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\pytest-of-john\\pytest-2183\\test_session_card_inline_expan0\\P\\.anchor\\projects/b478534e94d447de82ccb4c2e1bddb52/gandalf/index.json\nC:\\Users\\john\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\pytest-of-john\\pytest-2183\\test_session_card_inline_expan0\\P\\.anchor\\projects/b478534e94d447de82ccb4c2e1bddb52/planning/efforts/disc-b7f90850337bb521.pointer.json\nC:\\Users\\john\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\pytest-of-john\\pytest-2183\\test_session_card_inline_expan0\\P\\.anchor\\projects/b478534e94d447de82ccb4c2e1bddb52/planning/efforts/disc-fa5a5183e2b4d680.pointer.json\nC:\\Users\\john\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\pytest-of-john\\pytest-2183\\test_session_card_inline_expan0\\P\\.anchor\\projects/b